  - Confirm whether you need hard copies or digital exhibits and how the court wants them submitted
- Communication
  - Avoid discussing case details on social media or with third parties; follow litigation hold guidance

6) If you may testify: how to prepare and what to avoid
- Preparation
  - Review the timeline and documents repeatedly so your recollection is consistent
  - Practice short, direct answers. Pause if you need to think; ask to be allowed to answer fully
