7. Have you mitigated damages or attempted to limit the harm (notifications, notifications of breach)?
8. Is there a competing public interest or statutory restriction that affects enforceability (e.g., employment constraints, whistleblower/public policy)?
9. If seeking an injunction: why is monetary relief inadequate? What are the harms of granting/denying injunctive relief?
10. Procedural/Case management: any outstanding discovery? Proposed trial date? Witness list? Estimated trial length?

