- Timeline of key events (date-sorted)
- Copies of NDA and any related agreements
- Communications (emails, texts, messages) organized by date
- List of witnesses and summary of what each will say
- Any documents showing alleged harm/damages
- Financial and custody records (only if they are relevant or requested)
