- All communications relevant to the NDA: emails, texts, DMs, letters, phone call logs referencing disclosures (include dates and participants)
- Evidence of disclosure or use by the respondent: copies of publications, postings, contracts showing misuse, screenshots, timestamps, witnesses
- Consideration and transactional documents: invoices, payments, contracts, employment agreements that show why NDA was signed
