- Metadata and technical logs (file modification dates, access logs) if digital disclosure is alleged
- Any prior agreements or related contracts that alter or supersede the NDA
- Records of attempted resolutions, negotiations, or settlement efforts

E. Preparation and courtroom practice tips
- Coordinate tightly with Maria on what you will say: stay factual, concise, and consistent. Avoid volunteering extra information.
