  - Why did you disclose the information? (intent, purpose)
  - Were you under any financial pressure, personal motive, or external influence at the time?
  - Have you ever shared similar information before?

- Mitigation and damages
  - What steps did you take to mitigate harm once you realized a disclosure occurred?
